{
  "_comment": [
    "The PLACEHOLDER for the D'ni city (design 7.6): vanilla's ancient city, rerouted by pool aliases.",
    "Every pool the templates name is aliased to our copy under dni_city/, which carries our processor lists",
    "(no sculk sensors, our loot). The sculk pool -- the patches, the shriekers and so the warden -- goes to",
    "minecraft:empty. The aliases apply inside this structure only, so the overworld's cities are untouched.",
    "To try a room of your own, alias a pool to a pool of yours. Where it stands is decided in code, not by",
    "start_height: see DniCitySite."
  ],
